  "summary": {
    "value": "Hi3D v1.0 refines a coarse mesh into high-resolution geometry, conditioned on a reference image of the same object. Built upon the Sparc3D representation and refinement architecture, it progressively samples sparse latents, decodes them with a self-pruning sparse VAE, and extracts a mesh.",
